<header class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy</nav><h1>Privacy notice</h1></div></header>
<section class="band band-tight"><div class="wrap article prose">
<p><%= s.clinic_name %> collects the personal and health information you give us (name, contact details, date of birth, medical history and treatment notes) to provide physiotherapy care, manage appointments and billing, and send appointment messages.</p>
<h2>How we protect it</h2>
<ul><li>Records are only accessible to authorised clinic staff involved in your care. Staff accounts use strong passwords and two-factor authentication.</li>
<li>Every view or change of a patient record is logged.</li><li>Data is sent over encrypted connections (HTTPS) and backed up securely.</li></ul>
<h2>Messages</h2>
<p>If you agree, we send appointment confirmations and reminders by email and WhatsApp. You can switch these off at any time in your patient portal or by asking reception.</p>
<h2>Videos and maps</h2>
<p>Exercise videos are hosted on YouTube and load only when you press play. The map on our contact page is provided by Google.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can ask for a copy of your records, ask us to correct them, or ask how they are used by contacting <a href="mailto:<%= s.email %>"><%= s.email %></a> or <%= s.phone_primary %>. We keep clinical records for the period required by Nepali law and professional guidelines, including the Individual Privacy Act, 2075.</p>
</div></section>
